{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107865","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107865/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107865/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107865/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107865","id":3166275458,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6bkS0l","number":107865,"title":"Fix LSP symbol lookup failing due to skipping a character","user":{"login":"mphe","id":7116001,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMTYwMDE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7116001?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mphe","html_url":"https://github.com/mphe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mphe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mphe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mphe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mphe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mphe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mphe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mphe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mphe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mphe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":6,"created_at":"2025-06-22T21:06:50Z","updated_at":"2025-12-02T10:38:54Z","closed_at":"2025-12-02T10:35:51Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107865","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107865","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107865.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107865.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"This bug occurs when resolving a completion item (`completionItem/resolve`) and the cursor position reported by the LSP client is at the start of the completed item.\r\n\r\nIn that case `get_text_for_lookup_symbol()` will skip the character the cursor is placed on, thus never finds a string matching the given symbol name and causes the lookup to fail. This in turn prevents documentation for the completed symbol from showing up.\r\n\r\nThis scenario may occur with clients that have completion auto-insertion enabled, i.e. selecting a completion inserts it immediately.\r\nIn that scenario, the cursor position is technically at the first character of the completed item until the user starts typing again, implicitly accepting the completion.\r\n\r\nIt seemed like only functions were affected by this bug. Constants and members seemed to work fine.\r\n\r\nExample (cursor position is indicated by `|`):\r\n```gdscript\r\nnode.|\r\n# Now the completion list appears and we cycle through and select add_child()\r\n\r\n# Visual cursor position is at the end, but reported cursor position is at the beginning\r\nnode.a|dd_child(\r\n```\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107865/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107865/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}